  "培养方案中的专业方向课程要求修读 9 学分，分为“新药创制”“临床药学”“药学+X”三个方向。下列课程表保留原培养方案中的课程号、学分、周学时和建议学期。": "The professional orientation course of the training programme requires nine credits, divided into three directions: “New drug creation”, “Clinical pharmacology”, “Pharmacology+X”. The following curricula retain the curriculum number, credits, weekly hours and recommended term of the original programme.",
