  "这一页整理培养方案中不属于通识、专业必修和专业方向的部分，包括实践教学、毕业论文、个性修读、跨专业模块、国际化模块以及辅修培养方案。": "This page is part of a training programme that is not part of the general, professional and professional orientation, including practical teaching, diplomas, individual reading, cross-professional modules, internationalization modules and supplementary training programmes.",
  "实践教学环节": "Practical teaching sessions",
  "实践教学环节共 8 学分。": "The practical teaching cycle is 8 credits.",
  "药物科学研究实训": "Practical training in drug science",
  "药学社会实践": "Pharmacological social practice",
  "药学实习": "Pharmacology internship",
