  "毕业论文（设计）": "Graduate dissertation (design)",
  "毕业论文（设计）共 8 学分。": "Thesis (design) totalled 8 credits.",
  "毕业论文": "Graduate dissertation",
  "个性修读课程": "Individual Electives",
  "个性修读课程共 6 学分，是学校为学生设置的自主发展学分。学生可利用该部分学分自主选择感兴趣的本科课程、研究生课程或经认定的境内外交流课程；通识选修课程认定不得多于 2 学分。": "The personal education programme, which includes 6 credits, is an autonomous development credit for students in schools. Students may use this portion of their credits to choose, on their own initiative, courses of undergraduate, postgraduate or recognized internal and external exchange courses of interest; The generalization course is not recognized as more than 2 credits.",
  "跨专业模块": "Multidisciplinary module",
  "跨专业模块为 +3 学分，鼓励跨学科、跨专业交叉修读。辅修课程、外专业课程或经认定的跨学院（系）过程性教学环节可认定为该模块学分，并可根据修读情况计入辅修、个性修读或第二课堂。培养方案建议修读医学、生物学等专业微辅修课程。": "The multidisciplinary module is a +3 credit, which encourages cross-learning interdisciplinary and cross-professional fields. The supplementary course, extra-professional course or recognized inter-college (seminar) processal teaching may be recognized as the module credit and may be included in the supplementary, individualized or secondary classroom depending on the degree of study. The programme proposes micro-accompaniment courses in medicine, biology and other specialties.",
  "国际化模块": "Internationalized modules",
  "国际化模块为 +3 学分。可认定的环节包括境外高校 2+2、3+1 等联合培养项目，境外交流学习并获得学分的课程，境外 2 个月以上实习实践、毕业设计（论文）、科学研究等交流项目，以及学校认定的其他高水平国际化课程。": "The internationalized module is +3 credits. The identifiable links include joint training programmes at higher schools abroad, such as 2+2, 3+1, courses for exchange of studies and credits abroad, practical internships for more than 2 months abroad, programmes for graduation design (thesis), scientific research, etc., and other high-level internationalization courses identified by schools.",
  "辅修培养方案": "Secondary education programmes",
  "辅修部分包括微辅修、辅修专业和辅修学位。微辅修为 14 学分；辅修专业为 28 学分，在标注“*”的课程中选择修读，其中微辅修课程为必修；辅修学位为 71 学分，在修读标注“*”和“**”课程的基础上，修读实践教学环节课程和毕业论文（设计）。": "The ancillary component includes micro-accompanying, secondary specialties and secondary degrees. Micro-compensation of 14 credits; Accede 28 credits, opting for a course marked “*”, in which the minor study is compulsory; The degree is supplemented by 71 credits, which are based on the reading of the subject “*” and “**” and the study of the practical course and thesis (design).",
  "药物化学": "Drug chemistry",
  "药理学": "Pharmacology",
  "药剂学": "Pharmacy",
  "药物分析学": "Drug analysis",
  "培养方案中第二课堂、第三课堂、第四课堂分别作为毕业要求中的拓展学分模块。": "The second, third and fourth classes of the training programme are the extension modules of the graduation requirements.",
  "第二课堂": "Class 2",
  "第二课堂要求 +4 学分。通常用于认定校内外活动、社会实践、创新创业、志愿服务、学生组织与综合素质拓展等经历，具体以学校和学院当年认定细则为准。": "Class 2 requires +4 credits. It is usually used to identify experiences of internal and external activities, social practices, innovative entrepreneurship, volunteering, student organization and comprehensive quality development, which are determined by the school and college year.",
  "第三课堂": "Class III",
  "第三课堂要求 +2 学分。一般强调社会实践、劳动实践、志愿服务、基层实践等实践育人环节，实际认定方式以学校系统和学院通知为准。": "Class III requires +2 credits. The practice of social practice, labour practice, voluntary service, grass-roots practice and so forth are generally emphasized, and the practical identification is based on the school system and the circular of the Institute.",
  "第四课堂": "Classroom four.",
  "第四课堂要求 +2 学分。通常与国际化、创新实践、社会拓展或综合发展类经历相关，具体项目边界和认定材料需要参考学校最新要求。": "Class 4 requires +2 credits. Often associated with internationalization, innovative practices, social outreach or integrated development-type experiences, specific project boundaries and identification materials need to be informed by the latest school requirements.",
