  "可看到如下界面，先选择样品数量，再依次填写信息。": "The following interfaces are available, which select the number of samples and then fill in the information in a sequential manner.",
  "其中，引物类型若选择自带，需要在测序包装袋内分装足够多的引物；若选择合成，则进入以下界面，需要依次添加并选中所需的引物：": "Where the type of quotation, if it is selected for its own belt, it is necessary to have a sufficient number of quotations in the sequenced packaging bag; If synthesis is selected, the following interfaces are entered, and the required quotations are added and selected in order:",
  "“要求”一栏中，“单向”表示使用单一引物测序；“双向”表示使用两条引物测序，一般来说，对于目的片段直接使用PCR引物测序即可，对于测试目的片段是否两端酶切/延长等，建议设计中游的引物进行测序；“测通”表示给定两条引物，使用这两条引物将这条片段全部测出，适用于从两头往中间测。下表列出了选择方案：": "(a) In the column headed “Request”, “Unilateral” means the use of a single citation sequence; (a) “Dual-direction” means the use of two quotation sequences, which generally is sufficient for the purpose segment to be directly sequenced by PCR and is recommended for the design of mid-range quotations, for example, whether the test target segment is enzymes cut/extended; \"Detective\" means the given two quotations, which are used to detect the entire segment and are applicable to the measurement from both ends to the middle. The following table shows the options:",
