  "常规用品：": "General supplies:",
  "酒精喷壶、卫生纸和厨房用纸、解剖台、解剖剪和镊子、27G针头和21G针头、冰盒+冰、封口袋、记号笔、乳胶手套、鼠耳打孔器。": "Alcohol sprayers, toilet paper and kitchens are used for paper, anatomy table, anatomically cut and sting, 27G needles and 21G needles, ice box + ice, pocket seals, marker pens, emulsive gloves, rat ear-plugs.",
  "免疫组化预处理：": "Pre-treatment of immunization groups:",
  "PFA（4%，需提前在37℃水浴锅中融化，并分装于1.5或2ml管中）": "PFA (4% required to melt in a 37°C bathing pan and to be fitted in 1.5 or 2 ml tubes)",
