  "取血：": "Blood:",
  "取血针、EDTA-K采血管": "Blood needle, EDTA-K blood vessels",
  "抓握": "Hold on.",
  "规范以可以完全控制小鼠活动为准，并能够充分暴露鼠的胸部和腹部。": "The norms are based on the complete control of mouse activity and the full exposure of the breast and abdomen of the mouse.",
