  "部分组织为了获取无血液相关成分污染的切片，以在免疫组化时防止血浆相关成分的显色，常用心脏灌流，将血液先用生理盐水或PBS置换，再用4% PFA溶液置换，随后进行解剖。": "Some organizations have replaced blood with physico-saline or PBS, and 4% of PFA solution, followed by an autopsy, in order to obtain slices that are not contaminated with blood-related components, in order to prevent the visible plasma-related components during immunisation.",
  "准备工作": "Preparatory work",
