  "将注射管置于蠕动泵上，放置生理盐水溶液，开启蠕动泵以使管子内充满生理盐水。其中，CCW按钮为注射模式；CW按钮为抽吸模式；中间的按钮为泵体开关；右上角的按钮为加速，蠕动泵厂家：LongerPump。": "Put the syringe on the worm pump, place the physio-saline solution, and turn the graft pump on so that the tube is filled with physico-saline water. Of these, the CCW button is the injection mode; CW buttons are suction patterns; (b) Middle buttons are pump switches; The button at the top right corner is acceleration, the creep pump factory: LongerPump.",
  "麻醉、固定与扎针": "Anaesthesia, stationation and needles",
  "使用注射器对小鼠腹腔注射5% 水合氯醛以麻醉小鼠。待小鼠呼吸平稳且无剧烈反应时，将小鼠腹侧向上，使用针头固定四肢以暴露胸腹侧。过程中关注小鼠呼吸情况，灌流前需保证小鼠有正常心跳。": "5% of the abdominal cavity of mice injected with syringes. When the mouse is breathing smoothly and without violent reaction, the mouse is given abdomen up and a needle is used to fix the limbs to expose the abdomen. Attention is paid to the breathing of mice and to ensuring normal heartbeats before the flow.",
