  "生理盐水置换血液": "The saline water is replaced with blood.",
  "开启蠕动泵，观察泵出液体是否进入心脏，应见开口处血液涌出，心脏仍会保持跳动一段时间。保持针头位置不移动，必要时可用止血钳等固定针头位置。待血液全部被置换为生理盐水时，可见肝脏由暗红色变为白色，流出液体基本澄清，此时关闭蠕动泵。": "The movement of the worm pump to see whether the pump is entering the heart should be seen in the blood flow at the opening and the heart will remain beating for some time. Keep the needle position intact and, if necessary, use a fixed needle position such as a stopper. When the blood is replaced with a whole body of saline water, the liver is changed from dark red to white and the fluid is released with basic clarity, when the worm pump is shut down.",
