  "取采血针，在小鼠眼、鼻连线下端形成等边三角形的位置扎针，此处为颚动脉所在位置，应能自发流出血，旋开EDTA-K采血管，收集血液约0.5ml即可。": "The blood needle is taken, and the needle is placed in the position of the side triangle formed at the lower end of the mouse eye, nose line, where the jaw artery is located, which should be able to cause spontaneous bleeding, entanglement the EDTA-K vascular, and collect approximately 0.5 ml of blood.",
