  "（可选，更换新玻璃管时需要）安装玻璃电极，进行熔点测试。在每次更换新的玻璃电极时，应先进行熔点测试，评估该批次玻璃电极熔点，以确保加热值能够熔化玻璃电极但又不至于烧断铂金片，测试值作为程序的加热值参考（系统设置—熔点测试—点击“启/停”键）；": "(optional, needed to replace new glass tubes) Installation of glass electrodes and melting point testing. (a) Each replacement of a new glass electrode should be preceded by a melting point test to assess the batch of glass electrode melting points to ensure that the heating value can melt the glass electrode without burning the platinum tablets, and that the test value is used as a reference for heating the program (system settings-melting point test-click “start/stop”);",
  "根据所需要求创建新的程序或修改已有程序的参数（加热、速度、拉力、延时、气压、时间）：实验室常用参数（两步法）：": "Create new programs or modify parameters of existing programs (heating, velocity, pull, delay, pressure, time): Common parameters for laboratories (two-step approach):",
  "加热：674；速度：700；拉力：450；延时：0；气压：50；时间20；重复：1": "Heating: 674; Speed: 700; (a) pull: 450; Delay: 0; (b) Pressure: 50; Time 20; Repeat: 1",
  "加热：691；速度：850；拉力：999；延时：0；气压：50；时间20；重复：1": "(b) Heating: 691; Speed: 850; (a) pull: 999; Delay: 0; (b) Pressure: 50; Time 20; Repeat: 1",
