  "取一根玻璃管，型号为WPI（504949,ID:0.530 mm 25 m,OD:1.14 mm），从左侧车台中间插入并贯穿。": "Remove a glass tube, with the WPI model (504949, ID: 0.530 mm 25 m, OD: 1.14 mm), inserted from the middle of the left stage and penetrating.",
