  "手持固定，旋紧两侧车台固定旋钮，此时两侧车台拉伸玻璃管并保持固定。": "The handheld is fixed and the swirling is tight to the fixed slings on both sides, at which point the swirling of the glass pipes on both sides is stretched and fixed.",
  "关闭塑料罩，选择特定程序并开启，数秒后玻璃熔断并拉伸。": "Close the plastic mask, select a specific program and open it, and then the glass melts and stretches in seconds.",
