  "样本处理": "Sample processing",
  "*严格记录溶液体积，溶液体积用于计算整骨的细胞数量": "* Strictly record soluble volume, which is used to calculate the number of cells in the whole bone",
  "在混合溶液中，以1：9的比例加入Collagenase Ⅳ（即10X，Stock 1mg粉末溶于250ml PBS）；": "In mixed solution, add Collagenase IV (i.e., 10X, Stock 1mg powder dissolved in 250ml PBS) in the ratio of 1:9;",
