  "*当使用多种一抗时，可同时加入": "* When using multiple resistance, you can join at the same time",
  "*设计并记录抗体加入情况，抗体从冰箱拿出后立刻放在冰盒内，并按照加入顺序排布，避免混淆": ":: Design and record antibody accessions, which are placed in an ice box immediately after they are removed from the refrigerator and are routed in order of incorporation to avoid confusion",
  "*因DAPI染色迅速，不可提前加入，请在流式上样前加入": "* Please join the current because DAPI is rapidly dyeing and cannot be joined earlier.",
