  "此处展示femur免疫组化流程，对于其他软组织样品过程类似，存在以下不同：": "The process of immunisation of femur is shown here, and the following differences are observed for other soft tissue samples similar to those used:",
  "无需加入EDTA溶液，直接使用蔗糖进行脱水；": "Direct dehydration using sugar without the need to add EDTA solution;",
  "可以使用（也可以不用）含有低浓度PVP（0.5%）的包埋和脱水液；": "Packages and dehydration liquids containing low concentrations of PVP (0.5 per cent) may be used (or not);",
