  "对于震动切片的组织，由于切片较厚，建议使用漂染，整体效果优于贴片染色。": "For the tissue of the vibration slices, the thicker slices suggest the use of drifting, and the overall effect is better than the dyeing of the stickers.",
  "透化与封闭": "Visibility and Seal",
  "将待漂染的脑片放入细胞培养用六孔板中，若脑片从防冻液中拿出，应使用PBST清洗3遍。清洗时使用六孔板或12孔板清洗，使用挑片针挑入PBST溶液中，置于常温摇床上晃动5min。": "The brain tablets to be drifted should be placed in the six-hole plate for cell culture, and if they are taken from the anti-freeze fluid, they should be cleaned three times using PBST. The cleaning is done using a six or 12-coated plate, with a pickle to be picked into the PBST solution and moved 5min on the constant-temperature shaker.",
  "挑取数量合适的脑片进行染色，每个染色组最多放置2~3张脑片，并且做好区分。": "Pick a suitable number of brain fragments to dye, each dye group to a maximum of 2-3 brain chips and distinguish.",
  "向点滴板上每个孔中加入200ul的5% BSA-0.5% Triton-PBS溶液，使用挑片针将脑片挑入点滴板的孔中，将点滴板放入组化湿盒中，室温置于摇床上摇晃1h，以同时进行脑片的透化和封闭。": "Adding a 5% BSA-0.5% Triton-PBS solution to each hole on the dot-dip, using a pick-up pin to pull the brain into the drop-dip, putting the drop-dip into the group-wett box, and shaking the room temperature on the rocking bed for 1h, to dialysis and seal the brain-dip.",
  "*若使用PBST清洗，可不进行透化步骤；": ":: If PBS is used to clean, no intrusive steps are taken;",
  "*可使用驴血清或山羊血清（10%）进行封闭，方法同上（0.1% Tween或0.5%Triton配制）": ":: Closures may be made using ass serum or goat serum (10 per cent) as follows (0.1 per cent Tween or 0.5 per cent Triton formulation)",
  "一抗孵育": "- It's a fight against incubation.",
  "使用预冷的1% BSA-0.1% Triton-PBS溶液（或上一步对应的血清溶液）配制抗体，涡旋混匀后置于冰上待用。": "Antibodies are prepared using 1% BSA-0.1% pre-cold (or a serosol equivalent of the previous step) and vortex is modulated and placed on the ice for use.",
  "*每组染色使用200ul一抗，最少使用150ul一抗": "* 200ul for each group of dyes, at least 150ul for each group",
  "待封闭结束后，使用挑片针将脑片直接挑入点滴板上的一抗溶液中，此时可分组染色。使用封口膜覆盖点滴板表面避免水分蒸发，随后将点滴板放入组化湿盒中，置于4℃摇床上缓慢摇动过夜。": "When closed, the brain is drawn directly into an antisolvable solution on the drip sheet using a pick-up needle, which can be dyed in groups. The laminate surface is covered with a closed membrane to avoid evaporation and is then placed in a grouped wet box, where the stifling is slowly occurring at 4°C.",
  "二抗孵育": "Two-in-a-half.",
  "使用挑片针将脑片从一抗溶液中挑出，放回六孔板中，使用PBST清洗三次，每次清洗过程中将脑片移入新的PBST溶液中。": "The brain is removed from an antisolvation with a picket needle, placed back in the six-hole plate, and cleaned three times with PBST, each time the brain is moved into the new PBST solution.",
  "使用预冷的1% BSA-0.1% Triton-PBS溶液配制抗体和DAPI，涡旋混匀后置于冰上待用。": "Antibodies and DAPI are prepared using 1% BSA-0.1% pre-cold and vortex twirl and are placed on the ice.",
  "使用挑片针将脑片挑入点滴板上的二抗溶液中，此时可分组染色。使用封口膜覆盖点滴板表面避免水分蒸发，随后将点滴板放入组化湿盒中，置于常温摇床上缓慢摇动1h。": "Use a pickle to pick the brain into the dichotomy solution on the dripboard, where it can be dyed. The laminate surface is covered with a closed membrane to avoid evaporation and is then placed in a grouped wett box, where it is slowly shaking on the constant-temperature rock bed.",
  "使用挑片针将脑片从二抗溶液中挑出，放回六孔板中，使用PBST清洗三次，每次清洗过程中将脑片移入新的PBST溶液中。": "The brain is removed from the anti-difficult with a picket needle, returned to the six-hole plate, and cleaned three times with PBST, each time the brain is moved into the new PBST solution.",
  "准备经75%乙醇清洗的载玻片和盖玻片，预先写清相关信息。": "The ethanol-cleaned, 75% of the ethanol-carrying and caps are prepared for pre-writing of relevant information.",
  "准备一皿盖，在其中倒入少量的PBST溶液，将载玻片倾斜没入PBST溶液中，使用挑片针将待封片的脑片缓慢移到载玻片上方，并拖拽至合适位置。": "A vessel is prepared to be placed in a small PBST solution, which will tilt the carrying piece of the product and not into the PBST solution, and a pick-up needle will be used to slowly move the brain of the remaining block above the carrying piece and to drag it to the right position.",
  "避光放置，待脑片表面水分大部分晾干后，向每一个脑片表面滴加~50ul封片剂，使用洁净的盖玻片进行封片，最后使用指甲油固定盖玻片。": "The shiver is placed in a vacuum, and the bulk of the water on the surface of the brain is dried up, the ~50ul tablets are added to each of the brain tablets, the cover is made from clean cover, and the nail polish is finally used to fix the sheet.",
  "TSA漂染染色": "TSA is dyed.",
  "将待漂染的脑片放入细胞培养用六孔板中，若脑片从防冻液中拿出，复温后，应使用PBST清洗3遍。": "The brain tablets to be drifted should be placed in the six-hole plate for cell culture, and if they are taken from the anti-freeze fluid, the PBST should be used for three cleanouts after reheating.",
  "将脑片放入1ml柠檬酸钠抗原修复液中，放置于95℃金属浴上加热10min，等待自然冷却。": "Brain blades are placed in 1 ml of sodium citric acid antigen repair fluid, which is placed at 95°C metal baths, 10min to be heated, awaiting natural cooling.",
  "待封闭结束后，使用挑片针将脑片直接挑入点滴板上的一抗溶液中，使用封口膜覆盖点滴板表面避免水分蒸发，随后将点滴板放入组化湿盒中，置于4℃摇床上缓慢摇动过夜。": "After closure, the tablets are used to draw the brain into an antisolvable solution directly on the drip sheet, and the laminate surface is covered with a closed membranes to avoid the water evaporation, and the droplet is then placed in a grouping wet box, which is slowly shaking the bed at 4°C for the night.",
  "向点滴板中滴加200ul 3% H2O2溶液，将脑片转移至点滴板，常温摇床摇动1h，以进行封闭。": "Add 200ul 3% H2O2 solution to the dropboard, transfer the brain to dropboard, and shake the bed at a temperature of 1h to seal it.",
  "使用TSA二抗溶液配制二抗，向其中添加普通荧光素偶联抗体和DAPI，涡旋混匀后置于冰上待用。": "Use TSA-2 antisolvator to make the second resistance, adding common fluorescent-coup antibodies and DAPI, and vortex twig and then twirl and then put them on the ice.",
  "使用挑片针将脑片挑入点滴板上的二抗溶液中，使用封口膜覆盖点滴板表面避免水分蒸发，随后将点滴板放入组化湿盒中，置于常温摇床上缓慢摇动1h。": "The tablet is used to remove the brain into the dichotomy solution on the droplet plate, to avoid the water evaporation on the laminate surface of the closed membrane, and then to place the droplet in the group humid box, where it is slowly shaking in the constant-cooled shaker.",
