  "使用挑片针将脑片从TSA反应液中挑出，放回六孔板中，使用PBST清洗三次，每次清洗过程中将脑片移入新的PBST溶液中。": "The brain is removed from the TSA reaction fluid with a picket needle, returned to the six-hole plate, and cleaned three times with PBST, each time the brain is moved into the new PBST solution.",
