  "倒板需在超净台中进行，液体高度约3~5mm，注意旋转培养皿使得溶液平缓铺满底部。": "The reverse plate is to be carried out in a super-purified table, with liquid heights of about 3-5 mm, and it is to be noted that the rotation of the culture vessel allows the solution to be flattened to the bottom.",
