  "*避免长时间转膜，可能导致蛋白降解，转膜完毕后尽快拿出。": "*The avoidance of long-term membrane retinals, which may lead to protein degradation, and their release as soon as possible after completion.",
  "*转膜过程中电流大，避免溶液温度过热导致的蛋白降解。": "*The current during the membrane is high, avoiding protein degradation due to overheating of the solution.",
  "根据目标条带位置对电转膜进行切割，将自封袋进行裁剪，使用自封袋双面包裹膜后裁剪，可使膜不容易被裁坏。": "The membrane is cut according to the target strip position, the self-contained bag is cut, and the membrane is then cut using the double-covered bag, which makes the membrane less susceptible to deterioration.",
