  "将膜取出后放置于滤纸上，正反面均吸干水分，再将膜的蛋白面放置于HRP底物混合液的水珠上，保证其完全浸润。": "The film is removed and placed on the filter paper, with the water drained on the back and the protein surface of the film placed on the water bead of the mixture of HRP to ensure its complete immersion.",
