  "染色质免疫共沉淀CHIP-seq": "Chromosomal immuno-dwelling CHIP-seq",
  "用于分析与特定蛋白质相互作用的DNA片段。": "DNA fragments used to analyse interactions with specific proteins.",
  "待研究的蛋白质需要有其抗体，若无抗体，可将该蛋白质与标签蛋白结合，使用标签蛋白的抗体。": "Protein to be studied requires antibodies, which, if not antibodies, can be combined with labeled proteins and used as antibodies for labeled proteins.",
  "获得序列后，将会进行高通量测序。": "When you have the sequence, you will be given a high-throughput sequence.",
  "ChIP的基本原理是在活细胞的状态下，一些蛋白质可以与DNA相互作用，利用超声或核酸酶将蛋白质-DNA复合体随机切断为一定长度范围内的小片段，再通过抗体特异性富集所要研究的目的蛋白与DNA的复合体，最后通过对DNA片段的纯化与检测，从而获得DNA与蛋白质相互作用的信息。": "The rationale for the CHIP is that in the state of living cells, some proteins can interact with DNA, using ultrasound or nucleic acid enzymes to randomly cut the protein-DNA complex into small segments within a certain length, then obtain information on the interaction between DNA and the protein by the purpose protein and DNA complex to be studied by the antibody specificity enrichment, and finally by the purity and detection of the DNA fragments.",
  "ChIP可以分为自然ChIP（N-ChIP）和交联ChIP（X-ChIP）两种。在N-ChIP实验中，不使用甲醛等固定剂来使蛋白和DNA交联，而是用核酸酶来消化染色质。N-ChIP实验中蛋白质的抗原表位不受影响，但DNA与蛋白质结合较弱，因此一般用来研究组蛋白这种与DNA结合较强的蛋白。在X-ChIP中，使用甲醛等化学固定剂来使目的蛋白和DNA交联，并通过超声碎裂染色质。X-ChIP的优势在于它最大程度减少蛋白丢失的机会，适用于组蛋白和非组蛋白，并且通常需要的细胞起始材料少于N-ChIP。": "The CHIP can be divided into natural ChIP (N-ChIP) and conjunctivation ChIP (X-ChIP). In N-ChIP experiments, proteins are not used to interconnect with DNA using fixed agents such as formaldehyde, but rather nucleases are used to digest dyes. The antigen surface of proteins in N-ChIP experiments is unaffected, but DNA is less integrated with proteins and is therefore generally used to study group proteins, which are more strongly integrated with DNA. In X-ChIP, chemical fixants such as formaldehyde are used to interconnect the target protein with DNA and to break the chromosomes by ultrasound. The advantage of X-ChIP is that it minimizes the loss of protein, applies to both group and non-group proteins and typically requires fewer cell start materials than N-ChIP.",
  "注：配置工作液前请先配置母液：20%SDS；0.5M pH8.0 EDTA；1M pH7.8 Tris-Cl；10% TritonX100；5M NaCl": "Note: Configure the parent fluid before configuring the work fluid: 20% SDS; 0.5M pH8.0 EDTA; 1M pH7.8 Tris-Cl; 10% TritonX100; 5M Nacl",
