  "定容至250ml，暂存于-20℃。": "Fixed to 250 ml, reserved for 20°C.",
  "4% PFA-PBS溶液（200ml）": "4% PFA-PBS solution (200ml)",
  "大茂化学 30525-89-4": "Shigeochemistry 30525-89-4",
  "并向液体中加入几滴NaOH, 使溶液变澄清。调节pH=7.2~7.4，定容至200 ml。滤纸粗滤。": "And add a few drops of Naoh to the liquid to clarify the solution. PH = 7.2~ 7.4, fixed to 200 ml. Paper filter.",
  "20% 蔗糖- PBS溶液（50 ml）": "20% Sugar - PBS solution (50 ml)",
  "定容至50 ml": "Allow to 50 ml",
  "加入少量ddH2O溶解蔗糖，随后使用ddH2O定容至50 ml，溶液置于4℃保存。": "Add a small amount of ddH2O dissolved sugar, then use ddH2O to be contained to 50 ml, and the solution is kept at 4 °C.",
  "25% 蔗糖- PBS溶液（50 ml）": "25% sugar - PBS solution (50 ml)",
  "30% 蔗糖- PBS溶液（50 ml）": "30% Sugar - PBS solution (50 ml)",
