  "星形胶质细胞在最初培养时贴壁能力较弱，培养数代后增强，为了使细胞贴壁，在培养2~3代以内的星胶时应加倍DMEM/F-12培养基中FBS的含量为20%，同时使用铺有多聚赖氨酸的三角瓶进行培养。": "The stellar glycol cells are less able to paste walls at the initial stage of cultivation and are reinforced by generations. To develop the steroids, the amount of FBS in the 2-3 generation matrix should be doubled to 20% in the 2-3 generation frame, while being nurtured using triangular cylinders with polylylyle-lysine.",
