  "胰蛋白酶（trypsin）（+EDTA）：用于消化小块脑组织；用于传代时消化细胞。买来时浓度为2.5%，须使用HBSS缓冲液稀释至0.25%后使用。": "Insulin (trypsin) (+EDTA): used for digestion of small brain tissues; For intergenerational digestive cells. The concentration was 2.5% at the time of purchase and was to be diluted to 0.25% using HBSS buffer fluid.",
  "HBSS（Hank’s balanced salt solution）：缓冲液的一种，类似于细胞培养时的PBS，用于在培养基外短期维持细胞。主要用于暴露于大气环境中的培养基，不适用于CO2培养，后者使用HBSS培养基将超过HBSS的缓冲能力并导致细胞死亡。可用于细胞培养、稀释试剂时的缓冲液以及清洁条件下解剖组织的缓冲液。": "HBSS (Hank's base salt solution): A buffer fluid, similar to PBS in cell culture, for short-term cell maintenance outside culture. The culture base, which is primarily used for exposure to the atmosphere, does not apply to CO2 culture, which uses the HBSS culture base to exceed the buffer capacity of HBSS and to cause cell death. Buffer fluids for cell culture, diluting reagents and anatomical tissue under clean conditions.",
  "DMEM：DMEM为常规使用的无血清培养基，是一种合成培养基，其内含有葡萄糖、6种盐、13种必需氨基酸和8种维生素。": "DMEM: DMM is a conventional serum-free culture that is a synthetic culture that contains glucose, 6 salts, 13 essential amino acids and 8 vitamins.",
  "DMEM/F-12：为DMEM与营养因子F-12的1:1混合物，可以培养MDCK、神经胶质细胞、成纤维细胞等。F-12基于Ham的F-10培养基，增加了胆碱、肌醇、腐胺和氨基酸的浓度，添加了丙酮酸钠。用于培养原代星形胶质细胞。": "DMEM/F-12: A 1:1 mixture of DMEM and nutrition factor F-12, which can be developed for MDKK, neurogel cells, fibre cells, etc. F-12 based on Ham F-10 culture, increased concentrations of choline, muscular alcohol, scortamine and amino acid and added sodium acetone. It's used to develop the original star-shaped glycol cells.",
  "双抗。": "Double-resistant.",
