  "原代星形胶质细胞培养基配方：10% FBS、1% 双抗、1%谷氨酰胺，并使用DMEM/F-12进行补足。置于4℃保存。最开始培养原代细胞时应使用20% FBS，以达到较快的贴壁速度。": "Original stellar glycular culture base formulation: 10% FBS, 1% double resistance, 1% acetamamine, supplemented by DMEM/F-12. Saves it at 4°C. Twenty percent FBS should be used at the beginning of the culture of the original cell to achieve faster walling.",
  "耗材除常规细胞培养耗材外，还需准备适当数量（根据幼鼠数量确定）的已经包埋多聚赖氨酸的三角瓶。": "In addition to conventional cell culture, the materials need to be prepared for the appropriate quantity (based on the number of mice) of tritlas containing polylyle-lysine.",
  "大鼠P1幼崽分离星形胶质细胞": "Rat P1 pups separate star-shaped glycol cells",
