  "取高压灭菌的镊子、剪刀、弯镊用于取下大脑；取高压灭菌的高级镊子用于剥离脑组织表面脑膜。": "(b) The extraction of high pressure sterilisation stings, scissors, and machete is used to remove the brain; The high-pressure sterilisation sting is used to strip the surface of the brain tissue.",
  "取大鼠P1期幼崽，每一幼崽约获得1千万个星形胶质细胞，铺满1/2~2/3个三角瓶。将幼鼠直接浸泡于75% 乙醇溶液中，待基本死亡后转移至含HBSS缓冲液的培养皿中。": "The recovery of the P1 calves in rats gave each calf approximately 10 million star-shaped glue cells and 1/2-2/3 triangle bottles. The mice are immersed directly in 75% ethanol solution, and are transported to a cultured vessel containing HBSS buffers after basic death.",
