  "*注意更换手套后再进入超净台。": "* Be careful to change gloves before entering the ultra-purification table.",
  "取一只幼鼠，现在洁净的HBSS缓冲液中清洗，再转移至一空白培养皿中（可预先放一张滤纸）。": "Take a juvenile mouse and now wash it in clean HBSS buffer and then move it to a blank culturer (a filter can be pre-positioned).",
