  "用弯镊自后侧探入并托出脑组织，并将其转移至HBSS缓冲液中。": "A bend from the back and a brain tissue is inserted and transferred to the HBSS buffer.",
  "待全部幼鼠脑组织取完，取一装HBSS的新培养皿，置于体视显微镜下。为获得星胶细胞，需要分离脑组织表面的脑膜、髓质和海马体。": "After the brain tissue of all the mice is removed, a new platter with HBSS is taken and placed under the visual microscope. To acquire the stellar cell, it is necessary to separate the brain, marrow and seahorses from the surface of the brain tissue.",
