  "显微镜下可见出血点，将所有出血点及周边组织去除，最终保留的组织应完全为乳白色。星形胶质细胞主要位于大脑皮层上，可将髓质部分尽可能去除。": "The hemorrhages are visible under the microscope, removing all hemorrhages and surrounding tissues, which should be completely milked. Star-shaped rubber cells are located mainly on the cerebral cortex and the meds can be removed to the extent possible.",
  "将处理完毕的脑组织放入新的HBSS缓冲液中。": "The completed brain tissue is placed in the new HBSS buffer.",
