  "将消化产物转移至15ml离心管中，并使用DMEM/F-12冲洗培养皿，转移洗液于离心管中以终止消化。": "The digestive products are transferred to the 15ml centrifuge tube and the rinse of the culturer is used to remove the washing fluid from the centrifuge to stop digestion.",
