  "使用lipo2000脂质体进行转染": "It's a lepo2000 lipid.",
  "使用lipo2000对难以转染的细胞进行转染常常能够达到较高的转染效率。lipo2000为脂质体，脂质体能够对质粒进行包装，随后与细胞膜融合以达到转染质粒的目的。细胞密度约70%时进行转染，转染后48h后可进行转染效率的统计或后续实验。": "The use of lipo2000 for cell transfer is often more efficient. Lipo2000 is a lipid, which is capable of packaging the particles and then integrating them with the membranes for the purpose of changing the particles. The infection occurs at about 70 per cent of the cell density and can be followed by a conversion efficiency measure or subsequent experiments after 48h.",
  "贴壁生长的细胞密度达到~70%时，更换细胞培养基，可适当减少培养基用量以增大转染时lipo2000的有效浓度。": "The replacement of cell culture cells at ~70% cell density of the adhesion can reduce the use of the culture base appropriately to increase the effective concentration of lipo2000 at the time of the infection.",
  "*注意：理论上使用optimum代替培养基可获得更大的转染效率，但实际操作上并未获得": "*Note: Theoretically, the use of optimum instead of culture foundations can achieve greater efficiency in the transformation of the infection, but not in practice.",
