  "lipo2000的用量可在2倍~4倍之间摸索，即1ug质粒对应2ul lipo2000用量为1:2，一般而言，lipo2000用量越大，转染效率越高。": "The amount of lip2000 can be found between two and four times, i.e. the 1ug particle corresponds to 1/2 for 2ul lip2000, and generally the greater the lip2000 use, the more efficient the transfer.",
  "将待转染质粒、lipo2000和optimum转染buffer转移至生物安全柜中。按照所需的量分装好optimum转染buffer。": "Transfer of the filament particles, lipo2000 and optimum to bio-safety cabinets. Pack up the optimum-dissemination buffer in the required quantities.",
  "*以在4个六孔板孔里转染2个质粒为例，需要分装3个EP管（2个250ul，用于稀释质粒；1个500ul用于稀释lipo2000）": ":: Three EP tubes (2 250ul) for diluted particles, for example, in the case of two particles that were transducated in four six-hole pyrotechnical holes; 1 500ul for dilution lipo2000)",
