  "按照用量将混匀好的optimum-质粒-lipo2000溶液滴加进入细胞培养基中，晃动混匀，随后置于培养箱中培养4~6h或过夜；": "(b) The mixed optimum-mass-lipo2000 solution is added to the cell culturer by the amount of its use, which is then moved to the cell culture cell, and then placed in the incubator to develop 4-6h or to spend the night;",
