  "*注意一般的易于贴壁的细胞类型可以使用回收多次的PDL溶液，但对于原代神经元等不易贴壁的细胞类型需要使用回收2次及以下的1×PDL溶液；": "* Note that general cell types that are easy to top wall can use multiple recovery of PDF solutions, but for cells that are not easy to put on wall types such as genre neurons, 1 x PDF solution that is 2 times recovered and below;",
