  "在生物安全柜中将培养皿皿盖打开，铺展放置，同时关闭安全柜通风，开启紫外以进行杀菌。待PDL液体完全干透后进行清洗。": "The culture covers are opened in the biosafety cabinet, the placement is spread, while the safe is ventilated and ultraviolet is turned on for fungicide. Cleaning is done after the PDL liquid is completely dry.",
