  "准备常用论述结构": "Prepare common essay structures",
  "确认课程报告和展示要求": "Confirm report and presentation requirements",
  "课程以近代以来中国社会变迁为主线，串联重大历史事件、社会矛盾、道路选择和制度发展，核心是理解事件之间的因果关系。": "This course follows social change in modern China through major events, social tensions, political choices and institutional development. Focus on causal connections between events.",
  "先画时间轴，再把每个事件压缩成“背景—过程—影响—评价”。写报告时先确定问题意识，不要把材料简单堆成编年史。": "Draw a timeline first, then summarize each event as background, process, impact and assessment. Build reports around a question rather than a collection of chronological facts.",
  "近代中国社会性质与主要矛盾": "Social conditions and major tensions in modern China",
  "民族危机与各阶层的探索": "National crises and responses by different social groups",
  "新民主主义革命进程": "The course of the New Democratic Revolution",
  "新中国建设、改革开放与现代化": "Development, reform and modernization after 1949",
  "历史阶段与主要矛盾": "Historical periods and their major tensions",
  "革命道路的形成": "Formation of the revolutionary path",
  "历史事件的因果链": "Causal chains between historical events",
  "现代化道路选择": "Choices in the path to modernization",
  "年代、人名和事件顺序混淆": "Confusing dates, people and the sequence of events",
  "只描述过程，不分析原因和影响": "Describing events without analyzing causes or effects",
  "用后来的结论替代当时的历史条件": "Replacing historical conditions with hindsight",
  "独立画出主时间线": "Draw the main timeline independently",
