  "重看老师指定的报告范例": "Review the instructor's sample reports",
  "用历年题检查薄弱阶段": "Use past papers to identify weak periods",
  "课程以哲学、政治经济学和科学社会主义为主要板块，讨论物质与意识、实践与认识、社会发展规律、资本运行和人的解放。": "The course covers philosophy, political economy and scientific socialism: matter and consciousness, practice and knowledge, social development, capital and human emancipation.",
  "把它当作概念关系课来学。每个概念都写清“定义、相对概念、关系、例子”，再读对应原著片段，论文按“概念—文本—现实问题”展开。": "Study relationships between concepts. For each concept, record its definition, counterpart, relationships and an example, then read the assigned original texts. Structure essays around a concept, a text and a real-world issue.",
  "辩证唯物主义与认识论": "Dialectical materialism and epistemology",
