  "读完指定原著节选": "Read the assigned primary-text excerpts",
  "用历年论述题练习完整表达": "Practice complete answers to past essay questions",
  "课程围绕马克思主义中国化的历史进程，梳理不同时期形成的理论成果、实践背景与主要内容，并强调理论与中国具体实际的结合。": "This course traces the adaptation of Marxism to China, examining theories developed in different periods, their practical backgrounds and their main ideas, with emphasis on China's specific circumstances.",
  "按“时期—现实问题—理论回答—实践结果”做纵向表格。展示和调研报告要用具体案例支撑，不要把不同阶段的理论表述互相替换。": "Create a table of period, practical problem, theoretical response and outcome. Support presentations and research reports with concrete cases, and keep the terminology of different periods distinct.",
  "马克思主义中国化的提出与推进": "Origins and development of Marxism's adaptation to China",
  "新民主主义革命理论": "Theory of the New Democratic Revolution",
