  "准备可用于论述的调研案例": "Prepare fieldwork cases for essay answers",
  "课程按专题讨论新时代治国理政的总体框架，涉及发展、改革、法治、文化、民生、生态、安全和党的建设等主题。": "This course examines the framework of governance in the new era, including development, reform, law, culture, public welfare, ecology, security and Party building.",
  "按专题编号建立四栏笔记：“核心概念、政策表述、案例、思考题”。先掌握总框架，再补充各专题细节，能显著减少重复记忆。": "Organize each topic into four columns: core concepts, policy wording, cases and discussion questions. Learn the overall framework before the details to reduce repeated memorization.",
  "新时代的历史方位与总体布局": "Historical position and overall framework of the new era",
