  "课程覆盖国防、军事思想、战争形态、军事技术和国际安全形势，知识面较宽，但可以按思想、战争、技术和安全四个模块归纳。": "This course covers national defense, military thought, forms of warfare, military technology and international security. Organize the broad content into thought, warfare, technology and security.",
  "先建立模块框架，再把战争案例放入对应模块。论文可用“背景—作战方式—技术变化—启示”结构，考试则优先复习老师课件和题库。": "Build a framework, then place war cases within it. Structure papers around background, operations, technological change and lessons. Prioritize lecture slides and the question bank for exams.",
  "国防建设与国家安全": "National defense and security",
  "中外军事思想": "Chinese and international military thought",
  "战争形态和经典战例": "Forms of warfare and classic campaigns",
