  "课程介绍计算机系统、数据表示、办公与数据库工具、基础算法和计算思维，并通过实验训练实际操作能力。": "This course introduces computer systems, data representation, office and database tools, basic algorithms and computational thinking, with practical laboratory work.",
  "操作类内容必须亲手走一遍。把实验报告当作步骤模板，做完后用自己的话写出“输入、处理、输出、常见错误”。": "Perform each operation yourself. Use lab reports as step templates, then describe the input, processing, output and common errors in your own words.",
