  "课程从 Python 基础语法出发，逐步学习条件、循环、函数、字符串、列表、字典、文件和简单的问题求解。": "This course starts with Python syntax and develops conditionals, loops, functions, strings, lists, dictionaries, files and basic problem solving.",
  "边学边写，每个知识点至少独立写一个小程序。出错时先读报错位置和异常类型，再检查变量值，不要一开始就照抄答案。": "Write code as you learn, including at least one small program per topic. When an error occurs, read its location and exception type, then inspect variable values before consulting the answer.",
