  "完成函数拆分练习": "Practice splitting programs into functions",
  "重做错题并记录报错原因": "Redo incorrect exercises and record the causes",
  "课程建立极限、导数、积分、级数和多元微积分等数学工具，为后续物理化学、统计和药动学中的定量分析打基础。": "This course develops limits, derivatives, integrals, series and multivariable calculus, providing tools for quantitative work in physical chemistry, statistics and pharmacokinetics.",
  "按题型训练比泛读更有效。每类题保留一份“识别特征—标准步骤—适用条件—易错点”，错题隔几天不看答案重做。": "Practice by problem type. For each type, record identifying features, standard steps, assumptions and common mistakes. Redo incorrect problems a few days later without looking at the answers.",
  "函数、极限与连续": "Functions, limits and continuity",
