  "每类题完成至少三道变式": "Complete at least three variations of each problem type",
  "限时重做综合复习题": "Redo comprehensive review exercises under time limits",
  "课程研究如何可靠地确定物质的组成与含量，重点包括化学平衡、滴定分析、误差与数据处理，强调结果的准确度和可追溯性。": "This course studies reliable determination of chemical composition and quantity, including chemical equilibria, titration, errors and data analysis, with emphasis on accuracy and traceability.",
  "所有计算先写反应和平衡关系，再列物料、电荷或质子条件。滴定题要同时画出滴定阶段和判断指示剂范围。": "Write the reaction and equilibrium relationships before calculating, then establish mass, charge or proton balances. For titrations, identify the stage and the indicator's transition range.",
  "分析结果与误差处理": "Analytical results and error analysis",
  "酸碱平衡和酸碱滴定": "Acid-base equilibria and titration",
  "络合、沉淀与氧化还原滴定": "Complexometric, precipitation and redox titrations",
