  "掌握四类滴定计算框架": "Master calculation frameworks for the four titration types",
  "整理误差和有效数字规则": "Summarize error and significant-figure rules",
  "重做优秀作业和典型计算题": "Redo model assignments and typical calculations",
  "实验课训练有机合成的基本操作、安全规范、反应监测、产物纯化和实验报告表达，重点是把反应原理落实为可靠步骤。": "This laboratory course teaches organic synthesis techniques, safety, reaction monitoring, purification and report writing. Translate reaction principles into reliable experimental steps.",
  "实验前写一页预习卡：反应式、投料量、危险点、装置、关键温度和后处理。实验后立即记录现象，不要凭记忆补写。": "Prepare a one-page card before each lab: equation, quantities, hazards, apparatus, key temperatures and workup. Record observations immediately rather than reconstructing them from memory.",
