  "核对危险试剂和废液分类": "Check hazardous reagents and waste categories",
  "掌握产率与误差计算": "Master yield and error calculations",
  "完成报告中的异常原因分析": "Analyze unexpected results in the report",
  "课程研究有机分子的结构、性质和反应，主线是官能团转化、电子效应、反应机理与合成路线，为药物化学和天然药化打基础。": "This course studies organic structure, properties and reactions through functional-group transformations, electronic effects, mechanisms and synthesis, preparing for medicinal and natural products chemistry.",
  "不要按章节孤立背反应。用一张反应网络连接烯烃、卤代烃、醇、羰基、羧酸衍生物和胺，并在箭头上写条件、机理和选择性。": "Connect alkenes, haloalkanes, alcohols, carbonyl compounds, carboxylic acid derivatives and amines in a reaction network. Label each arrow with conditions, mechanism and selectivity rather than memorizing chapters separately.",
  "结构、命名、立体化学和电子效应": "Structure, nomenclature, stereochemistry and electronic effects",
