  "每个机制都用“刺激—感受器—中枢/通路—效应器—反馈结果”画成箭头图。题库只用来查漏，不能替代理解过程。": "Draw each mechanism as stimulus, receptor, center or pathway, effector and feedback. Use the question bank to find gaps, while retaining an understanding of the process.",
