  "课程一部分研究细菌、病毒等病原体的结构、致病与检测，另一部分研究先天和适应性免疫及其在感染、免疫疾病中的作用。": "The course covers pathogen structure, disease mechanisms and detection, alongside innate and adaptive immunity and their roles in infection and immune disorders.",
  "微生物按“结构—传播—致病—检测—防治”列表；免疫学按细胞和分子的相互作用画流程。实验图片要和判断依据一起记。": "Organize pathogens by structure, transmission, pathogenesis, detection and prevention. Draw immune cell and molecular interactions as flowcharts, and learn the evidence used to interpret experimental images.",
