  "课程研究生物大分子的结构与功能、能量代谢、物质代谢和遗传信息传递，核心是理解细胞内各通路如何连接和调控。": "This course studies biological macromolecules, energy and substance metabolism, and genetic information transfer. Focus on how cellular pathways connect and are regulated.",
  "代谢通路一定手绘：底物、产物、关键酶、能量变化、细胞定位和调控点同时标出。先理解碳流和能量流，再背细节。": "Draw metabolic pathways with substrates, products, key enzymes, energy changes, locations and regulation. Understand carbon and energy flow before memorizing details.",
  "蛋白质、酶、核酸和生物膜": "Proteins, enzymes, nucleic acids and membranes",
