  "课程研究天然产物的结构类型、理化性质、提取分离、结构鉴定和生物活性，连接有机化学、波谱和药物发现。": "This course studies natural product structures, properties, extraction, separation, identification and biological activity, connecting organic chemistry, spectroscopy and drug discovery.",
  "按化合物类别建立“基本骨架—取代特征—性质—提取方法—代表成分”表格。实验流程要理解每次溶剂和 pH 调整的目的。": "For each compound class, tabulate its scaffold, substitutions, properties, extraction methods and representative compounds. Understand why each solvent or pH adjustment is used in experiments.",
  "天然产物生源与结构分类": "Biosynthesis and classification of natural products",
