  "课程研究如何从医学和药学数据中获得可靠结论，完整过程包括研究问题、设计、数据整理、描述、推断和结果解释。": "This course studies reliable conclusions from medical and pharmaceutical data, from research questions and design through data preparation, description, inference and interpretation.",
  "不要先找公式，先判断变量类型、研究设计、比较目的和数据条件。每种检验整理成“何时用—前提—统计量—结果怎么写”。": "Identify variable types, study design, comparison goals and data conditions before choosing a formula. For each test, record when to use it, assumptions, the statistic and reporting conventions.",
  "医学数据类型与描述统计": "Medical data types and descriptive statistics",
