  "课程从化学结构解释药物的靶点作用、活性、选择性、代谢和成药性，重点是代表药物、药效团和构效关系。": "This course relates chemical structure to drug targets, activity, selectivity, metabolism and drug-like properties, emphasizing representative drugs, pharmacophores and structure-activity relationships.",
  "按药物类别整理“母核—关键取代基—靶点—机制—代表药—构效关系”。结构一定自己画，画完再解释每个基团为什么存在。": "For each drug class, record its scaffold, key substituents, target, mechanism, examples and structure-activity relationships. Draw structures yourself and explain the role of each group.",
  "药物作用的化学基础与构效关系": "Chemical foundations of drug action and structure-activity relationships",
