  "相似药物的取代位置混淆": "Confusing substitution positions in similar drugs",
  "机制和靶点对应错误": "Mismatching mechanisms and targets",
  "把提升活性的改造误认为一定提升成药性": "Assuming that higher potency always improves drug-like properties",
