  "每类药只抓一条主轴：“靶点—生理改变—治疗作用—不良反应”。先掌握代表药，再比较同类药差异，避免平铺药名。": "Use one chain for each drug class: target, physiological change, therapeutic effect and adverse effect. Learn representative drugs first, then compare differences within the class.",
