  "课程介绍光谱、电化学、色谱等仪器分析方法的原理、仪器组成、定性定量方式及其在药物检测中的应用。": "This course introduces spectroscopy, electrochemical analysis and chromatography: principles, instrument components, identification, quantification and pharmaceutical applications.",
  "把每种方法整理成同一张对照表：激发/分离原理、信号、仪器部件、定量依据、适用对象、优缺点和干扰。": "Use the same comparison table for each method: excitation or separation principle, signal, components, quantitative basis, suitable samples, strengths, limitations and interference.",
